deadline two-day-documents-period: 2.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(c), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1007-1(e): the debtor provides the trustee and any timely
/// requesting creditor copies of payment advices at least 7 days before the
