deadline payment-advices-period: 7.days before MeetingOfCreditorsScheduled() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(e), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1007-1(e): a creditor's request for payment advices is timely
/// if received at least 14 days before the first date set for the meeting
/// of creditors.
deadline payment-advices-request-period: 14.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(e), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1007-1(f): the chapter 11 debtor serves Local Form A on each
/// creditor scheduled as disputed, contingent or unliquidated within 14
/// days after filing the schedules of liabilities.
deadline disputed-creditor-notice-period: 14.days after Chapter11SchedulesFiled() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(f), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1007-1(f): or within 14 days of adding such creditors to
/// previously filed schedules.
deadline added-disputed-creditor-notice-period: 14.days after DisputedCreditorAdded() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(f), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1007-1(f): the debtor files a certificate of service within 14
/// days of service.
deadline disputed-creditor-certificate-period: 14.days after DisputedCreditorNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1007-1(f), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1009-1: in asset cases, a creditor added by amendment may file
/// a proof of claim within 90 days of service of the notice, or within the
/// time set for previously scheduled creditors, whichever is later.
deadline added-creditor-claim-period: 90.days after AddedCreditorNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1009-1, 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1009-1: in a chapter 7 case, an added creditor may file
/// complaints under 11 U.S.C. §§ 523 and 727 and exemption objections
