deadline consolidated-schedules-period: 14.days after ConsolidationGranted() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1015-1(c), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 1017-2(a): the court may dismiss for want of prosecution unless
/// the debtor cures or a party requests a hearing within 14 days of service
/// of the notice of intent to dismiss.
deadline dismissal-hearing-request-period: 14.days after DismissalNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 1017-2(a), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 2003-1(a): the presiding officer files a report of action taken
/// no later than 3 days after the § 341 meeting.
deadline meeting-report-period: 3.days after MeetingOfCreditorsHeld() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 2003-1(a), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 2003-1(a): the chapter 7 trustee files a Report of No
