deadline examination-objection-period: 14.days after ExaminationMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 2004-1(d), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 2014-1(e): an employment application filed within 14 days of
