deadline retroactive-employment-period: 14.days after ProfessionalEngagementBegan() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 2014-1(e), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
/// P.R. LBR 2016-1(f): a chapter 13 fee application of $500 or less may be
