deadline small-fee-application-objection-period: 21.days after FeeApplicationNoticed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 2016-1(f), 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
