deadline trustee-report-period: 60.days after TrusteeAppointed() counted_by frbp9006-puerto-rico cite ?("P.R. LBR 3016-1, 2013 complete list: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED against later general orders (GO 19-01 not vendored); the value is the vendored text, unverified") {}
