start motion-filed

state motion-filed: "Motion filed with response-time notice" by applicant cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
{
  note "A motion carries the notice of P.R. LBR 9013-1(c)(1): 14 days to respond after service (the excepted periods of 9013-1(c)(2)), unless it is one of the matters of 9013-1(c)(3) that need no response time; an urgent motion follows 9013-1(a) and an ex parte motion 9013-1(b). The motion's FRBP periods are lit/frbp's."
  edge-motion-filed-response "Objection or response filed" -> response {
    authority cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
    within response-period
  }
  edge-motion-filed-unopposed "No timely response; deemed unopposed and may be granted" -> decided {
    authority cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
  }
}

state response: "Objection or response filed" by opponent cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
{
  note "An opposition, reply or sur-reply needs no response-time language (P.R. LBR 9013-1(c)(3)(C))."
  edge-response-ruling "Matter heard" -> ruling { authority cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)" }
}

decision ruling: "Motion decided" by court cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
{
  note "A remedy granted by default needs the movant's affidavit of military service under the Servicemembers Civil Relief Act (P.R. LBR 9013-1(c)(4))."
  edge-ruling-granted "Granted" -> decided { authority cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)" }
  edge-ruling-denied "Denied" -> decided { authority cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)" }
}

terminal decided: "Matter decided: the case continues under lit/frbp" outcome [procedural] cite "P.R. LBR (GO 18-02) 9013-1(c)"
{
  note "The Local Bankruptcy Rules govern cases before the court (P.R. LBR 1001-1; its text is the CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED complete list)."
}

